# Admin studio (markevita.com/studio) — proxied to the backend service.
#
# The studio is a Python service and cannot run on Netlify's static hosting,
# so it lives on its own host (Fly.io, Railway, Render, a VPS...). Uncomment
# the line below and replace STUDIO_BACKEND_HOST once that host exists.
# It must stay ABOVE the catch-all, which would otherwise swallow /studio.
#
# /studio/*  https://STUDIO_BACKEND_HOST/:splat  200
#
# Until it is uncommented the public site behaves exactly as before.

